<title>USA: Westvaco Q3 shr reduced.</title>
<headline>Westvaco Q3 shr reduced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westvaco Corp</p>
<p>			Consolidated Statement of Income</p>
<p>				 (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			     In thousands, except per share</p>
<p>				Third quarter	   Nine months</p>
<p>				ended July 31	  ended July 31</p>
